.TITLE "softwareupdate"

.DIV "DESCRIPTION"
Manages system software updates. It provides a way to download and install macOS updates and security patches from Apple servers.

.DIV "TLDR"
**softwareupdate -l**
Lists all available software updates for the current system.
> __-l__ list flag

**softwareupdate -i -a**
Downloads and installs all available software updates.
> __-i__ install flag | __-a__ all flag

**softwareupdate -i -r**
Installs only the updates that Apple marks as recommended.
> __-i__ install flag | __-r__ recommended flag

**softwareupdate --fetch-full-installer**
Downloads the complete macOS installer for the current version to the Applications folder.
> __--fetch-full-installer__ download flag

.DIV "SUMMARY"
Running `**softwareupdate -i -a**` requires __administrator__ privileges and often triggers a system restart once the installation is complete.

.DIV "SEE ALSO"
**linux:apt**

